; Fixture for test_scene_geometry.gd — the ONLY place an imported .glb is instanced in a scene
; until M2 Phase 2's first real asset lands. It exists so the measurement harness that guards the
; "visible but unusable" bug class is itself proven against imported art, rather than being trusted
; and found wanting at the moment the first building arrives.
;
; The offset transform is deliberate: it proves body_box() composes the instance's own geometry
; with the placing node's transform, which is exactly what a real art swap depends on.

